                gen "Fair point. So what happened next?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Neutral expression, prompting further story.
                ast "It was a nightmare! The Chef yelled that I wasn’t leaving the kitchen until I proved my innocence! So I decided to *escape!*" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "mid") # Anger, narrowed eyes (determination), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils center (emphasis).
                gen "You… ran?" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, amused disbelief.
                ast "Yes! I ran down the hallway, still dripping wet, but then—" ("angry", "narrow", "worried", "R") # Anger, narrowed eyes (annoyance), worried eyebrows (annoyance), pupils right (anticipation).
                ast @ cheeks blush "My uniform got caught on the door! I pulled, and… well… let’s just say I escaped with *less clothing* than I’d have liked." ("grin","base","angry","ahegao") # Soft expression, narrowed eyes (embarrassment), neutral eyebrows (shame), pupils downR (shame).
                gen "Oh wow. That explains why you look like you fought a tornado." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, amused observation.
                ast "But that’s not even the worst part! As I was running, I saw a steel cable connecting our building to the next one. I thought, *‘This is my chance to escape!’*" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "up") # Anger, narrowed eyes (determination), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils up (determination).
                gen "Wait… you didn’t…" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, anticipating.
                ast "I did! I ripped off my shirt, wrapped it around the cable, and tried to zip-line to the other building!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "ahegao") # Anger, narrowed eyes (desperation), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils ahegao (desperation).
                gen "You… used your *shirt* as a zip-line?!" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, incredulous amusement.
                ast "Yes! But the cable was too loose, and I got stuck *right in the middle*—completely shirtless, arms raised, just… dangling there!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "down") # Anger, narrowed eyes (despair), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils down (despair).
                gen "Oh no…" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, feigned sympathy.
                ast "Oh yes! I was swinging back and forth, calling for help, and *everyone* stopped to watch! Even the pigeons were staring!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "L") # Anger, narrowed eyes (indignation), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils left (emphasis).
                gen "I’m sure it was… *memorable.*" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, amused sarcasm.
                ast "Memorable?! I was *humiliated!* And to make matters worse, the guards had to *rescue me* with a ladder!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "mid") # Anger, narrowed eyes (indignation), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils center (emphasis).
                gen "Well, at least you gave everyone a good show." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, teasing.
                gen "That’s a sight I wish I’d seen." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, teasing.
                ast "And then, just when I thought my reputation was officially dead…" ("angry", "narrow", "worried", "R") # Anger, narrowed eyes (annoyance), worried eyebrows (annoyance), pupils right (anticipation).
                ast "We found the real thief!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "up") # Anger, narrowed eyes (determination), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils up (determination).
                gen "Ah, now it gets interesting! Who was it?" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, curious.
                ast "The Chef’s assistant! He hid the sauce in his *hat!*" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "ahegao") # Anger, narrowed eyes (shock), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils ahegao (desperation).
                gen "Wait… he stole it and just walked around with it on his head?" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, incredulous amusement.
                ast "Yes! But guess who still had to clean up the entire mess because I was *supposedly* an accomplice?!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "down") # Anger, narrowed eyes (indignation), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils down (disgust).
                gen "You?" ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, teasing.
                ast "ME!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "L") # Anger, narrowed eyes (indignation), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils left (emphasis).
                ast "And now I’m here, soaked, humiliated, and with half my reputation intact!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "mid") # Anger, narrowed eyes (indignation), furrowed eyebrows (fury), pupils center (emphasis).
                gen "Well, I think we learned an important lesson here." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Grin, teasing.
                ast "Oh, really? And what would that be?" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "R") # Anger

        "-Dismiss her-":
            gen "Great, then that will be all for now." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Neutral expression, dismissing.
            gen "Your sentence reduction are updated.." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Neutral expression, confirming.

    gen "Good job, Astoria." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head") # Neutral expression, giving praise.
    ast "Thank you, [name_genie_astoria]." ("base", "narrow", "base", "down") # Neutral expression, narrowed eyes (slight hesitation), neutral eyebrows (polite acceptance), pupils down (polite acceptance).
    ast "Here's the payment." ("grin", "base", "base", "mid") # Soft expression, neutral expression, neutral eyebrows, pupils center (presenting).
    nar "You receive {number=payment} gold coins." # Narration, no facial expression.
    $ game.gold += payment

    call ast_walk(action="leave")

    $ astoria.equip(ast_outfit_last)

    $ states.ast.busy = True
    $ current_job = None

    jump main_room_menu

#Send Astoria to work.

